Package: devjam-x11-monitor-config
Version: 1.1-4
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: X11 display size confs for the CLS lab monitors
 X11 monitor profiles with the physical display size of the monitors in
 the CLS lab, for correct DPI, and the switch-x11-monitor command that
 installs the chosen profile in /etc/X11/xorg.conf.d.
